  <name>gLabels Plus</name>
  <summary>Design and print labels and business cards</summary>
  <description>
    <p>gLabels Plus is a label designer for address labels, name tags, price tags,
    barcode and shipping labels, stickers, CD/DVD labels and business cards. It works
    with the peel-off label and card sheets sold in office supply stores and with
    thermal roll printers.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Thousands of built-in templates for sheet and roll labels, plus custom sizes</li>
      <li>Text, curved text, images, lines, shapes, symbols and barcodes, including QR codes</li>
      <li>Mail merge from CSV and other data files to print a unique label for each record</li>
      <li>Variables and counters for serial numbers</li>
      <li>Projects to group labels by business or client</li>
      <li>Optional Claude chat panel for designing labels with an AI assistant, using the separately installed Claude Code tool</li>
    </ul>
    <p>gLabels Plus is a fork of gLabels by Jaye Evins.</p>
  </description>
